# Saga of the Phoenix Knight (Q070) from cond 4: Felix trades the reward item for the first
# Resonance Amulet; the first Tablet of Vision takes it, with the resonance animation on the
# player and on the tablet; ten Guardians of Forbidden Knowledge give the second amulet (the
# kill count is a quest variable, dropped at the tenth); the second tablet takes it; the third
# tablet wakes the corrupted knight as its private, far away at its spot, and answers the same
# player that its fight is on. Expectations of the traced steps are the reference trace's; the rest are derived from the
# reference source (ThirdClassQuest.java, Q070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight.java).
